## 🛠️ Installation & Quick Start  

```bash
# 1️⃣ Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/LGxNDaRY-GeekedOutAi/Neoguard-OS-Deep-Dive.git
cd Neoguard-OS-Deep-Dive

# 2️⃣ Create a virtual environment (recommended)
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate   # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate

# 3️⃣ Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt   # (generated from the workspace’s lock file)

# 4️⃣ (Optional) Configure LM Studio / AI sentinel
#    Copy `.env.example` → `.env` and set:
#       NETGUARD_LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1
#       NETGUARD_LLM_MODEL=netguard-llm
#       NETGUARD_LLM_API_KEY=<your‑key>

# 5️⃣ Run the tray monitor
python -m netgradient          # runs as system‑tray GUI (admin rights needed for blocking)
📚 Usage Notes



Command	Effect
python -m netguard	Starts the system‑tray guardian; requires admin for firewall block actions.
python -m netguard --diagnostic 30	Takes a 30‑second snapshot, writes netguard_diagnostic_<timestamp>.json with connection stats, blocked events, and AI verdicts.
python -m netguard.smoke_throughput	Runs the throughput smoke test; exits 0 only when global & per‑process deltas are finite, non‑sentinel values.
python -m netguard --help	Lists all available CLI flags and configuration options.
